          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akamwambia tena mara ya pili, Simoni wa Yohana, wanipenda? Akamwambia, Ndiyo, Bwana, wewe wajua kuwa nakupenda. Akamwambia, Chunga kondoo wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
